TI  - Coral reef diagenesis records pore-fluid evolution and paleohydrology of a siliciclastic basin margin succession (Eocene South Pyrenean foreland basin, northeastern Spain)
T2  - GEOLOGICAL SOCIETY OF AMERICA BULLETIN
