TI  - Archaeal and Bacterial Communities Associated with the Surface Mucus of Caribbean Corals Differ in Their Degree of Host Specificity and Community Turnover Over Reefs
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - MICROBIAL DIVERSITY
KW  - BIOGEOGRAPHY
KW  - VARIABILITY
KW  - HEALTHY
KW  - TISSUE
