TI  - Corallite size and spacing as an aspect of niche-partitioning in tabulate corals of Silurian reefs, Racine Formation, North America
T2  - LETHAIA
LA  - English
KW  - HELIOLITINE CORALS
KW  - PALEOZOIC CORALS
