TI  - An analysis of the bacterial community in and around scleractinian corals of Phu Quoc Island, Vietnam
T2  - REGIONAL STUDIES IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Coral
KW  - Sediment
KW  - Seawater
