TI  - Housekeeping Mutualisms: Do More Symbionts Facilitate Host Performance?
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - ANTAGONISTIC INTERACTIONS
KW  - COMMUNITY STRUCTURE
KW  - SEDIMENT-REJECTION
KW  - CORALS
