TI  - Juveniles of the Atlantic coral, Favia fragum (Esper, 1797) do not invest energy to maintain calcification under ocean acidification
T2  - JOURNAL OF EXPERIMENTAL MARINE BIOLOGY AND ECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - CALCIUM-CARBONATE SATURATION
