TI  - First assessment of microplastic accumulation and characteristics in the zoanthid Palythoa caesia across coral reef ecosystems in Thailand
T2  - FRONTIERS IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - coral reef ecosystem
KW  - microplastic pollution
KW  - polymer identification
KW  - spatial variability
