TI  - POST-EXTINCTION BIOFACIES OF THE FIRST CARBONATE RAMP OF THE EARLY JURASSIC (SINEMURIAN) IN NE PANTHALASSA (NEW YORK CANYON, NEVADA, USA)
T2  - PALAIOS
LA  - English
KW  - LOWER TRIASSIC CARBONATES
