TI  - Bioerosion and sediment ingestion by the Caribbean parrotfish Scarus vetula and Sparisoma viride: Implications of fish size, feeding mode and habitat use
T2  - MARINE ECOLOGY PROGRESS SERIES
LA  - English
KW  - coral reefs
