TI  - Non-Hawaiian lithostratigraphy of Louisville seamounts and the formation of high-latitude oceanic islands and guyots
T2  - JOURNAL OF VOLCANOLOGY AND GEOTHERMAL RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - RIDGE AZORES ARCHIPELAGO
KW  - CENTRAL PACIFIC SEAWATER
KW  - INSULAR SHELVES
KW  - MORPHOLOGICAL RECORD
