TI  - Assessing the ecological risk to deep-sea megafaunal assemblages from seafloor massive sulfide mining using a functional traits sensitivity approach
T2  - OCEAN & COASTAL MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Deep-sea mining
KW  - Seafloor massive sulfides
KW  - Seamounts
KW  - New Zealand
