TI  - Core microbiome of corals Pocillopora damicornis and Pocillopora verrucosa in the northeastern tropical Pacific
T2  - MARINE ECOLOGY-AN EVOLUTIONARY PERSPECTIVE
LA  - English
KW  - anthropogenic stressors
KW  - coral holobiont
KW  - metabarcoding
