TI  - Breathing of a coral cay: Tracing tidally driven seawater recirculation in permeable coral reef sediments
T2  - JOURNAL OF GEOPHYSICAL RESEARCH-OCEANS
LA  - English
KW  - SUBMARINE GROUNDWATER DISCHARGE
KW  - GREAT-BARRIER-REEF
KW  - COASTAL ZONE
KW  - BIOGEOCHEMICAL RESPONSES
