TI  - Functional metagenomics reveals differential chitin degradation and utilization features across free-living and host-associated marine microbiomes
T2  - MICROBIOME
LA  - English
KW  - Chitinases
KW  - Chitosan
KW  - Metagenomics
KW  - Nitrogen cycling
KW  - Carbon cycling
KW  - Marine sponges
