TI  - The palaeoecological significance of tubes, ribs, pallial canals and flanges in caprinoid rudist bivalves
T2  - PALAEOGEOGRAPHY PALAEOCLIMATOLOGY PALAEOECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Titanosarcolites
