TI  - Effects of nearshore evaporation rates on the design of seabed gallery intake systems for SWRO facilities located along the Red Sea shoreline of Saudi Arabia
T2  - DESALINATION AND WATER TREATMENT
LA  - English
CP  - European-Desalination-Society (EuroMed) Conference on Desalination for Clean Water and Energy
