FX  - This work has been supported by the Petromaks Project 163316/S30 "Carbonate Reservoirs Geomodels", funded by the NFR (The Research Council of Norway), StatoilHydro, ConocoPhillips, DNO, and IRIS. Additional support was provided by the "Ministerio de Educacion y Ciencia" (Spain), Project CGL2007-60774/BTE and Topo-Iberia Consolider Ingenio 2006 (CSD 2006-00041). We thank Jeff Lukasik and an anonymous reviewer for their detailed and helpful comments. Mike Talbot passed away on November 6, 2009, in Bergen, Norway. Mike had a varied research interest that was focussed on limnogeology, modern and ancient rift sedimentation, as well as carbonate sedimentology and diagenesis. He started his professional career as a carbonate sedimentologist, and over the last 10 years much of his research again centred on these fascinating deposits.
